By the way, you want to make some holy water and bless that bag ASAP.
An uncursed BoH reduces weight by 1/2.  A blessed bag by 1/4.  Note
this is true only for the BoH, not for a sack (which may appear as a
bag until you identify it).  If you just found a "bag" in the dungeon
outside of Sokoban, be sure to identify it (with a scroll) so you know
it isn't a sack.

