I'm slightly confused - did you have 3HP before you Polymorphed or as
a result of polymorphing?

Your hit points in your new form are sort of "play" points.  If you
polymorph into a monster and have 10 hit points and take 10 hit
points' worth of damage, you don't die - you revert to your previous
form (and back to as many hit points as you had before you
polymorphed).



